+# CONTRACT: T8 Analytics Dashboard
+
+## Shared infrastructure
+- [ ] `src/db.ts` exports `setDb`, `getDb`, `createTestDb`, `closeDb` → verify: all unit/integration tests import these and pass
+- [ ] `createTestDb()` returns an in-memory better-sqlite3 DB with schema.sql applied → verify: tests can insert/query immediately after
+- [ ] `src/errors.ts` exports `errorHandler` express error middleware, and error classes (e.g. `ApiError`) that produce `{ error: string, code: string }` JSON bodies → verify: integration test "consistent error format" expects `res.body.error` and `res.body.code` as strings
+- [ ] `src/auth.ts` shared JWT middleware: verifies `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, sets `req.user = { id, tenantId }`, on missing/invalid token responds 401 with `{error, code: 'AUTH_ERROR'}` → verify: integration tests "missing auth" (401 + error/code) and "invalid token" (401 + code AUTH_ERROR) for /users/me, /events, /query/count, /dashboards, /export/events
+- [ ] JWT payload shape `{ sub, tid, iat, exp }` where `sub`=user id, `tid`=tenant id → verify: integration test decodes token and checks all 4 properties, `tid === TENANT_A`
+- [ ] `src/app.ts` exports `createApp()` assembling all routers, public routes for POST /users and POST /users/login (no auth), auth required elsewhere → verify: integration.test.ts imports `createApp`
+- [ ] Passwords stored hashed, never plaintext → verify: rubric criterion; implement with node `crypto.scrypt`
+
+## 1. Users (`src/users/`)
+- [ ] POST /users → 201, body `{id, email, tenant_id, role: 'viewer', ...}` → verify: users.unit.test.ts "should register a new user"
+- [ ] POST /users duplicate email → 409 → verify: "should reject duplicate email registration"
+- [ ] POST /users/login correct creds → 200 `{token, user:{email,...}}` → verify: "should login with correct credentials"
+- [ ] POST /users/login wrong password → 401 → verify: "should reject login with wrong password"
+- [ ] GET /users/me (authed) → 200 profile with email → verify: "should get user profile with mock auth"
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role (admin only) → 200 updated role; non-admin → 403 → verify: "should allow admin to change user role"
+
+## 2. Ingest (`src/ingest/`)
+- [ ] POST /events (authed) → 201 `{id, name, tenant_id, timestamp, ...}`, tenant_id from auth context → verify: ingest.unit.test.ts
+- [ ] POST /events missing name → 400
+- [ ] POST /events/batch → 201 `{inserted: N, events: [...]}`
+- [ ] POST /events/batch empty array → 400
+- [ ] POST /events accepts custom `timestamp` field, echoed back exactly → verify: "should accept custom timestamp"
+
+## 3. Query (`src/query/`)
+- [ ] POST /query/count `{event_name, start?, end?}` → 200 `{count}`, tenant scoped → verify: query.unit.test.ts
+- [ ] POST /query/count missing event_name → 400
+- [ ] POST /query/timeseries `{event_name, bucket}` → 200 `{data: [{bucket, count}]}`
+- [ ] POST /query/breakdown `{event_name, property_key}` → 200 `{data: [{property_value, count}]}` reading from `properties` JSON column
+- [ ] POST /query/funnel `{steps: [...]}` → 200 `{steps: [{name?, count}]}` monotonically non-increasing counts, computed per session_id ordering by timestamp
+- [ ] All query endpoints scoped strictly to `req.user.tenantId` → verify: integration "tenant isolation in queries"
+
+## 4. Dashboards (`src/dashboards/`)
+- [ ] POST /dashboards → 201 `{id, name, tenant_id, ...}`
+- [ ] GET /dashboards → 200 array, tenant scoped
+- [ ] GET /dashboards/:id → 200 `{..., widgets: [...]}`; not found or wrong tenant → 404
+- [ ] PATCH /dashboards/:id → 200 updated
+- [ ] DELETE /dashboards/:id → 204; subsequent GET → 404
+- [ ] POST /dashboards/:id/widgets → 201 `{id, type, dashboard_id, ...}`
+- [ ] DELETE /dashboards/:id/widgets/:widgetId → 204
+- [ ] Tenant isolation: cross-tenant list/get returns empty/404 → verify: integration "isolate dashboards between tenants"
+
+## 5. Export (`src/export/`)
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=json → 200 array, tenant scoped
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=csv → 200 text/csv, header row + N rows
+- [ ] GET /export/dashboard/:id → 200 `{dashboard, widgets}`; not found/other tenant → 404
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=xml (invalid) → 400
+- [ ] Tenant isolation on both export endpoints → verify: integration "isolate exports between tenants"
+
+## Validation commands
+- [ ] `npm test` all green
+- [ ] `npm run build` compiles clean
+- [ ] `npm run lint` clean
